flowchart TB
    subgraph Business[业务逻辑层]
        SM[safety_main 主控/线程]
        AP[alarm_process 报警/附件]
    end
    subgraph Capability[能力层]
        P1[ti_safety_protocol 天迈协议]
        P2[subiao_safety_protocol 苏标协议]
        C1[safety_conf 参数注册表/SQLite/App JSON]
        C2[external_data_center 仪表/三急/雷达]
        C3[alg_activate 算法激活]
    end
    subgraph Alg[算法抽象层]
        API[alg_abstract_api_st 统一接口]
        ARC[虹软实现 alg_api_ARC]
        MOTO[魔视实现 alg_api_MOTOVIS]
    end
    subgraph Adapter[适配层]
        AD[adapter 共享内存/域通信/日志/工具]
    end
    SM --> AP
    AP --> P1 & P2 & C1 & C2
    SM --> API
    API --> ARC & MOTO
    API --> AD
